/*
 * Implements validation and construction of integer literal values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   • decimal, hexadecimal, binary, and octal integer literals,
 *   • underscore removal inside numeric components,
 *   • suffix-based type selection(u8, u16, i32, isize, …),
 *   • overflow checking against the target integer type.
 *
 * Integer literals are always parsed as unsigned magnitudes; unary minus is
 * handled by the expression validator, not by this module.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::literal::int
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/literal/int.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-25
